*PPD-Adobe: "4.3"
*FormatVersion: "4.3"
*FileVersion: "1.0"
*LanguageVersion: English
*LanguageEncoding: ISOLatin1
*PCFileName: "KODAKPD4.PPD"
*Manufacturer: "Kodak"
*Product: "(Kodak PD460)"
*ModelName: "Kodak PD460"
*ShortNickName: "Kodak PD460"
*NickName: "Kodak PD460 Photo Printer Dock, kodakdock"
*PSVersion: "(3010.000) 0"
*LanguageLevel: "3"
*ColorDevice: True
*DefaultColorSpace: RGB
*FileSystem: False
*Throughput: "1"
*LandscapeOrientation: Plus90
*TTRasterizer: Type42
*cupsVersion: 2.4
*cupsModelNumber: 460
*cupsManualCopies: False
*cupsFilter: "application/vnd.cups-raster 0 rastertokodakdock"

*% Dye-sub 4x6 only, borderless. The filter maps the page onto the part of
*% the raster the printer actually puts on paper. A white border is a driver
*% option (KodakBorder, used as a queue default for a "white border" printer,
*% since iOS shows no per-printer options) and a paper type for clients that
*% show one, such as macOS.
*OpenUI *PageSize/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageSize
*DefaultPageSize: 4x6.Fullbleed
*PageSize 4x6.Fullbleed/4x6 in Borderless: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageSize

*OpenUI *PageRegion/Media Size: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *PageRegion
*DefaultPageRegion: 4x6.Fullbleed
*PageRegion 4x6.Fullbleed/4x6 in Borderless: "<</PageSize[288 432]/ImagingBBox null>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *PageRegion

*DefaultImageableArea: 4x6.Fullbleed
*ImageableArea 4x6.Fullbleed/4x6 in Borderless: "0 0 288 432"
*DefaultPaperDimension: 4x6.Fullbleed
*PaperDimension 4x6.Fullbleed/4x6 in Borderless: "288 432"

*% Border as a paper type too; AirPrint clients that show "Paper Type" can
*% pick it. The filter reads it from the raster header's MediaType.
*OpenUI *MediaType/Paper Type: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *MediaType
*DefaultMediaType: photographic
*MediaType photographic/Photo (Borderless): "<</MediaType(photographic)>>setpagedevice"
*MediaType white-border/Photo with White Border: "<</MediaType(white-border)>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *MediaType

*OpenUI *KodakBorder/Border: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 20 AnySetup *KodakBorder
*DefaultKodakBorder: None
*KodakBorder None/Borderless: ""
*KodakBorder White/White Border: ""
*CloseUI: *KodakBorder

*OpenUI *ColorModel/Color Mode: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *ColorModel
*DefaultColorModel: RGB
*ColorModel RGB/Color: "<</cupsColorSpace 1/cupsColorOrder 0/cupsBitsPerColor 8>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *ColorModel

*OpenUI *Resolution/Resolution: PickOne
*OrderDependency: 10 AnySetup *Resolution
*DefaultResolution: 300dpi
*Resolution 300dpi/300 DPI: "<</HWResolution[300 300]>>setpagedevice"
*CloseUI: *Resolution

*DefaultFont: Courier
*Font Courier: Standard "(002.004S)" Standard ROM
